---
source: crates/rune-config/tests/composition.rs
description: a nest one level deeper than rune runs
expression: error
---
`n0` nests scripts deeper than rune goes: 65 levels, and the limit is 64.

  n0 → n1 → n2 → … 59 more … → n62 → n63 → n64

the limit is rune's own, so a config that loads on one operating system loads on all of them.
